==About==
===Format===
* '''Group Stage:''' ''April 1<sup>st</sup> - May 1<sup>st</sup>, 2026''
** Two Single-Round Robin Groups
*** Each Group has 6 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 4 teams}} from each group advance to ''Playoffs''
*** {{Bgcolortext|seedup|Winners}} have a bye into the ''Upper Bracket Semifinals''
*** {{Bgcolortext|up|2<sup>nd</sup> & 3<sup>rd</sup>-placed teams}} advance to ''Upper Bracket Round 1''
*** {{Bgcolortext|stayup|4<sup>th</sup>-placed teams}} start from ''Lower Bracket Round 1''
** <span class="mw-customtoggle-Kickoff-Drawshow" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for detailed information about Group Stage Draw''</span>
<div class="table-responsive">
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Kickoff-Drawshow" style="margin-top:10px;" style="margin-left:45px;">
* 12 Teams are divided into 6 seeds as per their final standings in [[VCT/2026/EMEA League/Kickoff|Kickoff 2026]].
** '''Pool 1''' consists of 11th & 12th of Kickoff: {{Team|FUT Esports}} & {{Team|PCIFIC Esports}}
** '''Pool 2''' consists of 9th & 10th of Kickoff: {{Team|Karmine Corp}} & {{Team|ULF Esports}}
** '''Pool 3''' consists of 7th & 8th of Kickoff: {{Team|GIANTX}} & {{Team|Natus Vincere}}
** '''Pool 4''' consists of 5th & 6th of Kickoff: {{Team|Team Vitality}} & {{Team|Team Heretics}}
** '''Pool 5''' consists of 3rd & 4th of Kickoff: {{Team|Team Liquid}} & {{Team|Fnatic}}
** '''Pool 6''' consists of top 2 of Kickoff: {{Team|BBL Esports}} & {{Team|Gentle Mates}}
* Each group will comprise of a team from Pool 1 to 4, and 2 teams from pool 5.
</div></div>
*<span class="mw-customtoggle-Tiebreaker" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for tiebreaker rules''</span>
<div class="table-responsive">
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Tiebreaker" style="margin-left:45px">
*'''Tiebreaker rules:'''
*#Head-to-head Match Score
*#Head-to-head Map Differential
*#Head-to-head Round Differential
*#Map Differential
*#Round Differential
*In a 3+ team tiebreaker, if it was able to tiebreak some teams, but a subset of teams remain tied, a new tiebreaker is then applied from the beginning.
</div></div>

* '''Playoffs:''' ''May 7<sup>th</sup> - May 17<sup>th</sup>, 2026''
** Double-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Lower Bracket Final & Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Lower Bracket Final & Grand Final are {{Abbr/Bo5}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 3 teams}} qualify for '''[[VCT/2026/Stage 2/Masters|Masters London]]'''
*** Starting of '''Playoffs''', [[Ascent]] replace [[Bind]] in the map pool.

